temple.  If you say reload a sparring partner will load for you.  If you say
rewield it will load a weapon and wield it.  Now with all these triggers does
come responsibility.  I don't want to come on to hear that someone in our clan
has abused it due to "boredom" or for "fun" or any thing lame like that.  So
please don't.  It is after all here for your benefit.  Also with the reload and
rewield, make sure you do not use the rewield trigger unless there is a mob
there to wield the weapon.    
